```console
$ scherzo-cloud auth --help
Manage your Scherzo Cloud sign-in

Usage: scherzo-cloud auth [COMMAND]

Commands:
  identities  Manage your linked sign-in identities
  login       Sign in to Scherzo Cloud
  logout      Sign out of Scherzo Cloud on this device
  status      Show your Scherzo Cloud sign-in status
  help        Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help  Print help

```
